(@set06_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Woman: This is the exchange programme briefing, so let me cover housing first. — Student: Will we be placed with a host family? — Woman: Most of you will, but you can also apply for a shared flat. — Student: And what is the deadline for the housing form? — Woman: It is the end of the month, a week before course registration.','TTS','["Giving information about an exchange programme","Conducting a job interview","Selling theatre tickets","Checking a physics lab"]','A',1,'The woman frames the talk as an exchange programme briefing about housing, so she is giving programme information.',78),
(@set06_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Woman: This is the exchange programme briefing, so let me cover housing first. — Student: Will we be placed with a host family? — Woman: Most of you will, but you can also apply for a shared flat. — Student: And what is the deadline for the housing form? — Woman: It is the end of the month, a week before course registration.','TTS','["A hotel","A shared flat","Campus dorms only","No housing at all"]','B',1,'Besides a host family, the coordinator mentions applying for a shared flat.',79),
