(@set06_exam_id,'SPEAKING','SPEAK_REPEAT','Listen to the sentence and repeat it out loud.','Good communication keeps a group project moving smoothly toward its deadline.','TTS',NULL,NULL,0,'Repeat the sentence with a natural stress on communication and deadline.',117),
(@set06_exam_id,'SPEAKING','SPEAK_INTERVIEW','Some students prefer to study alone, while others learn best in a group. Explain which way works better for you and give two reasons with details from your own experience. You have about forty seconds to respond.',NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,0,'A good answer states a clear preference, gives two distinct reasons, and supports each with a specific personal example.',118),
(@set06_exam_id,'SPEAKING','SPEAK_INTERVIEW','If your campus could add one new facility, such as a sports centre, a study cafe, or a quiet garden, which would you choose and why? Include at least one reason and one concrete detail. You have about thirty-five seconds to respond.',NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,0,'A good answer names one facility, explains the choice with a clear reason, and adds a supporting detail.',119),
(@set06_exam_id,'SPEAKING','SPEAK_INTERVIEW','Some people like to plan their free time in advance, while others prefer to decide spontaneously. Talk about how you usually spend your weekends and why you do it that way. You have about forty seconds to respond.',NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,0,'A good answer describes a personal habit, explains it with a reason, and offers a relevant detail.',120);
